<div class="note-row sustainability-note1">
    <div class="page-width">
        <div class="columns">
            <div class="col-item col-left">
                <h2>Innovation at the<br> heart of our mission</h2>
                <p>Our dedication to sustainability is reflected <br>in our innovative initiatives:</p>
                <picture class="mission-img-holder">
                    <img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1249/7859/files/wooden-storage-img.png?v=1701415280" alt="innovative initiatives" />
                </picture>
            </div>
            <div class="col-item col-right">
                <ul class="list-number">
                    <li><strong>Recycling Programs:</strong> We have implemented various recycling programs within our operations, including the weekly recycling of aluminium, steel, cardboard, plastic, and melamine off-cuts and removed furniture. This not only reduces waste but also promotes responsible resource management.</li>
                    <li><strong>Circular Economy:</strong> JasonL actively participates in the circular economy by repurposing old and unwanted furniture, extending its lifespan and reducing unnecessary waste.</li>
                    <li><strong>Improved Product Packaging:</strong> We are constantly working to enhance our product packaging and reduce single-use plastics, aligning our practices with sustainability goals.</li>
                    <li><strong>Investment in Machinery:</strong> Our investments in machinery for improved pallet wrapping not only enhance our operational efficiency but also minimize material waste.</li>
                    <li><strong>Transition to Paper Pallets:</strong> We have replaced wooden pallets with paper pallets, making it easier for end-users to recycle and contribute to a more sustainable environment.</li>
                    <li><strong>Solar-Powered Distribution Centre:</strong> Our 7,000-square-meter distribution centre is powered entirely by solar energy, demonstrating our commitment to renewable energy sources and environmental responsibility.</li>
                    <li><strong>Transition to Electric Vehicles: </strong>We are actively working towards replacing our fleet of vehicles and trucks with electric vehicles (EVs) by 2025, reducing emissions associated with our transportation operations.</li>
                </ul>
                <picture class="mission-img-holder">
                    <img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1249/7859/files/wooden-storage-img.png?v=1701415280" alt="wooden-storage" />
                </picture>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="note-row sustainability-note2 bg-color">
    <div class="page-width">
        <div class="columns">
            <div class="col-item col-left">
                <h2>Industry impact</h2>
                <p>While quantifying the exact impact on the industry and the environment is a complex task, we are proud to say that our sustainability efforts translate into tons of waste diverted from landfills. </p>
                <p>Our commitment to sustainability also requires substantial investment, creating employment opportunities and supporting local businesses. </p>
                <p>Moreover, our significant use of solar power reduces our dependence on traditional energy sources, contributing to a cleaner and more sustainable energy future.</p>
            </div>
