<div class="note-row sustainability-note3">
    <div class="page-width">
        <div class="columns">
            <div class="col-item col-left">
                <h2>Embracing sustainability <br>as our driving force</h2>
                <p>Sustainability is a guiding principle in our business. We engage in ongoing discussions within the company on how to improve our environmental impact. Our weekly town hall meetings prioritize sustainability, and we encourage our team to contribute innovative ideas to drive our sustainability initiatives forward.</p>
                <p>We have also joined organizations such as the Australian Packaging Covenant Organisation (APCO) and obtained ISO 14001 certification, showcasing our dedication to responsible practices.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="col-item col-right">
                <h2>Setting and achieving sustainability goals</h2>
                <p>At JasonL, we set yearly sustainability goals and actively track our progress towards achieving them. While the exact impact of our sustainability initiatives can be challenging to quantify, our commitment to reducing waste, promoting sustainability, and creating employment opportunities remains unwavering.</p>
                <p>We invite you to join us on our journey towards a greener, more responsible future. By choosing JasonL, you are supporting a company that not only provides high-quality products and services but also takes active steps to minimize its environmental footprint, benefiting the industry and the broader community.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

